window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-c78c32b5e0641f8e"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"productivity-collaboration\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">效率与协作</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>跨插件、数据和团队协调工作。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 协调跨插件、文件和团队的工作。ChatGPT 可以从文件、消息、文档和电子表格中汇总背景，再将其整理成可分享的成果。对于依赖代码库、可复现脚本或 Git 工作树（worktree）的数据项目，请使用 Codex。</p> <p><a id=\"learn-a-new-concept\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">学习新概念</h2> <p>让 ChatGPT 将内容密集的论文、规范或技术指南整理成定义、示例和待思考的问题，供你审阅。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/learn-a-new-concept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">学习新概念（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 学习研究论文或课程等材料，并将阅读内容拆分成……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"delegate-multi-step-workflows\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">委派多步骤工作流</h2> <p>让 ChatGPT 从多个插件中收集经批准的输入来准备工作流程，也可以让它使用电脑在桌面应用间完成任务。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/new-hire-onboarding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">协调新员工入职（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 ChatGPT 收集经批准的新员工背景信息，准备跟踪表更新，并起草按团队整理的……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/use-your-computer-with-codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用 ChatGPT 操作电脑（本地尚未收录）</a>：在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中使用 Computer Use，跨 macOS 或 Windows 应用完成指定任务……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"keep-work-moving\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">让工作持续推进</h2> <p>让 ChatGPT 检查你批准的来源，只返回需要关注的事项，例如明确的请求、发生变化的文件、受阻的交接、回复草稿和待作决定。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">设置工作事务助理（本地尚未收录）</a>：将 ChatGPT Work 设置为工作事务助理，检查你连接的消息、电子邮件……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/manage-your-inbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">整理收件箱（本地尚未收录）</a>：清理积压的邮件，并识别哪些邮件需要回复、作决定或进一步关注……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/complete-tasks-from-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">处理消息中的任务（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Computer Use 阅读一个 Messages 对话串，完成其中的任务并起草回复。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"work-with-data\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">处理数据</h2> <p>使用 ChatGPT 探索数据集、整理电子表格、检验假设、回答问题并创建可视化内容。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/clean-messy-data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">清理并准备杂乱数据（本地尚未收录）</a>：拖入或提及杂乱的 CSV 或电子表格，说明你发现的问题，然后提出……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/analyze-data-export\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">构建保持最新的仪表板（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 ChatGPT Work 将电子表格整理成私有交互式 Site，并检查……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"build-a-reproducible-analysis\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">构建可复现的分析</h2> <p>使用 Codex 在代码库中清理并合并数据、通过代码探索假设，并把结果整理成可审阅、可重复运行的产物。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/datasets-and-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">分析数据集并交付报告（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT Work 清理数据、合并数据集、探索问题、建立模型并……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"package-analysis-into-reviewable-artifacts\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">将分析整理成可审阅的成果</h2> <p>让 ChatGPT 将经过批准的输入整理成可分享的输出，例如幻灯片、消息和其他待审阅成果。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/feedback-synthesis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">分析来自多个工具的产品反馈（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT Work 提供来自 Slack、问卷、问题跟踪工具、支持记录或研究笔记的反馈……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/generate-slide-decks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">创建或修改幻灯片（本地尚未收录）</a>：根据源材料创建或修改 Google Slides 或 PowerPoint 演示文稿……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"productivity-collaboration\">Productivity &amp; Collaboration</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Coordinate work across plugins, data, and teams.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to coordinate work across plugins, files, and teams. ChatGPT can gather context from files, messages, docs, and spreadsheets, then turn it into shareable artifacts. For data projects that depend on a repository, reproducible scripts, or worktrees, use Codex.</p> <h2 id=\"learn-a-new-concept\">Learn a new concept</h2> <p>Ask ChatGPT to turn a dense paper, spec, or technical guide into definitions, examples, and questions you can review.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/learn-a-new-concept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn a new concept (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT to study material such as research papers or courses, split the reading across...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"delegate-multi-step-workflows\">Delegate multi-step workflows</h2> <p>Have ChatGPT gather approved inputs from multiple plugins to prepare a workflow, or let it use your computer to complete tasks across desktop apps.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/new-hire-onboarding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Coordinate new-hire onboarding (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT to gather approved new-hire context, stage tracker updates, draft team-by-team...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/use-your-computer-with-codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Use your computer with ChatGPT (not in this local snapshot)</a>: In the ChatGPT desktop app, use Computer Use to complete a scoped task across macOS or...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"keep-work-moving\">Keep work moving</h2> <p>Have ChatGPT check the sources you approve and return only the items that need attention: real asks, changed artifacts, blocked handoffs, reply drafts, and decisions.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Set up a work chief of staff (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Set up ChatGPT Work as a chief of staff that checks your connected messages, email...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/manage-your-inbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get your email to inbox zero (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Clear an overloaded inbox and see which messages need a reply, a decision, or your attention</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/complete-tasks-from-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Complete tasks from messages (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Computer Use to read one Messages thread, complete the task, and draft a reply.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"work-with-data\">Work with data</h2> <p>Use ChatGPT to explore datasets, clean up spreadsheets, test hypotheses, answer questions, and create visualizations.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/clean-messy-data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clean and prepare messy data (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Drag in or mention a messy CSV or spreadsheet, describe the problems you see, and ask...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/analyze-data-export\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build a dashboard that stays up to date (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Ask ChatGPT Work to turn your spreadsheets into a private, interactive Site, check the...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"build-a-reproducible-analysis\">Build a reproducible analysis</h2> <p>Use Codex to clean and join datasets in a repository, explore hypotheses with code, and package the results as reviewable, rerunnable artifacts.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/datasets-and-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Analyze datasets and ship reports (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT Work to clean data, join sources, explore a question, model the result, and...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"package-analysis-into-reviewable-artifacts\">Package analysis into reviewable artifacts</h2> <p>Let ChatGPT turn approved inputs into outputs you can share: slides, messages, and other artifacts ready for review.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/feedback-synthesis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Analyze product feedback across tools (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT Work feedback from Slack, surveys, issue trackers, support, or research notes</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/generate-slide-decks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create or revise a slide deck (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Create or revise a Google Slides or PowerPoint presentation from source material, a...</li> </ul>"};
